  triage:title "SkillArg.name should be ArgName not String (catalog.rs:16)" ;
  triage:description "SkillArg.name is defined as String at line 16 of catalog.rs. Per RBP best practices and ADR-0011 (type safety), this should use the ArgName newtype defined in extensions/mod.rs, providing compile-time validation that flag names are non-empty and consistently typed across the extensions module." ;
